@DevHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health (DEVHUB-003). Anonymous; 200 Healthy / 503 Unhealthy.
GET {{DevHub.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document. Development and Staging only; 404 in Production.
